# Example price file for causal_analysis.py (replace with real TTF/Brent history).
# Point config.yaml paths.price_source (or env PRICE_SOURCE_PATH) at your file.
#
# Wide format (aliases resolved automatically):
#   date, ttf, brent
#   Trade Date, TTF_EUR, Brent_Close
#
# Long format also supported:
#   date, symbol, close
#   2025-01-02, ICE Brent, 74.2
#   2025-01-02, Dutch TTF, 32.1
#
# date,ttf,brent
# 2025-01-02,31.5,74.1
# 2025-01-03,32.0,74.8
